# SQLite assets for web (WASM) deployment
#
# Place your dictionary SQLite files here before building for web.
# Example layout (replace CODE with actual dict code):
#
#   CODE.sqlite            — main dictionary database (required)
#   CODEab.sqlite          — abbreviations database (optional)
#   CODEauthtooltips.sqlite — author/source tooltips (optional)
#   CODEbib.sqlite         — bibliography database (optional)
#
# The app auto-detects which files are present — no code changes needed
# when adding or removing dictionaries.
#
# This .gitkeep file keeps the folder tracked by git when it's empty.
# Delete it once you add your first .sqlite file.
